            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-medium mb-6 relative z-10 leading-relaxed">Seu portfólio está visível para potenciais clientes em <span class="text-orange-500">Malha3D.com</span></p>
            <button class="w-full py-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-all relative z-10">Configurar Link</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Portfolio Grid -->
