                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium leading-relaxed line-clamp-2">Modelagem avançada com texturização PBR e renderização em Octane para campanha global.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Portfolio Item 2 -->
        <div class="group relative glass-card border-white/5 bg-white/[0.01] rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden transition-all hover:border-blue-500/30">
            <div class="aspect-video bg-white/5 relative overflow-hidden">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1614850523296-d8c1af93d400?w=800&auto=format&fit=crop" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:scale-110" alt="">
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-gray-950 via-gray-900/20 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-500 flex flex-col justify-end p-8">
                    <div class="flex gap-3 transform translate-y-4 group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-transform duration-500">
                        <button class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10 p-3 rounded-2xl text-white hover:bg-orange-500 hover:border-orange-500 transition-all shadow-2xl">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl">edit</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10 p-3 rounded-2xl text-white hover:bg-blue-500 hover:border-blue-500 transition-all shadow-2xl">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl">visibility</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-8">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
                    <h4 class="text-lg font-black text-white tracking-tight truncate group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">Estátua Colecionável - Ares</h4>
                    <span class="text-[9px] font-black text-blue-400 bg-blue-500/10 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-blue-500/20 uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">Modelagem</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium leading-relaxed line-clamp-2">Escultura digital em alta resolução focada em impressão 3D de alta fidelidade.</p>
            </div>
